      "SourceSection": "4.3: Got Caffeine?",
      "SourceExcerpt": "But what if we wanted to find the amount of medicine in the patient’s body each hour after taking it? We know there are 3 equal groups of 1 hour in a 3-hour period. We also know that because the medicine decays exponentially, it decays by…",
